#: src/main.glade:440
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Ita kuti huchokwadi hwechiso kuti uvhure otomatiki kiyi yako yekupinda kana "
"KWallet paunopinda. Izvi zvinochengetedza password yako yakavharwa muTPM "
"kana iripo, kana yakavharidzirwa ne AES-256-GCM uchishandisa midzi-chete "
"master kiyi. Face auth set PAM_AUTHTOK ye pam_gnome_keyring kana "
"pam_kwallet5 zvichienderana nedesktop yako."

#: src/main.glade:471
msgid "Current Status:"
msgstr "Mamiriro Azvino:"

#: src/main.glade:486
msgid "Checking..."
msgstr "Kutarisa..."

